cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this analysis or methodology, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Greek Banking Sector Analysis 2022–2024"
version: "2.0.0"
abstract: >
  Financial analysis of the four listed Greek banking groups (Alpha Services
  and Holdings, Eurobank Ergasias Services and Holdings, National Bank of
  Greece, Piraeus Financial Holdings) for fiscal years 2022-2024, built from
  their annual reports with Python, pandas, SQLite, Plotly and Streamlit. Every
  number is traced to a report page. Includes 5-step DuPont decomposition, a
  CAMELS-style scorecard, peer benchmarking, NII scenarios, a one-year stress
  test and a justified P/TBV model.
